('492c71cb-10d9-5b8b-a50b-1d9e96380336','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',1,'term',1,'{}','Lethargic','Lacking energy, feeling unnaturally sleepy or slow due to extreme fatigue.','After days without proper sleep, the exhausted Chinese emperor felt extremely [Lethargic].','خامل','le-thar-gic','assets/photos/lethargic.jpg','assets/anims/lethargic.gif','assets/audio/lethargic.m4a'),
('2bbe5fbb-7664-5f92-998c-19cb8982db70','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',2,'term',1,'{}','Ailing','Suffering from illness, physical weakness, or poor health.','The royal doctor arrived at court to examine the [Ailing] sovereign.','عليل / مريض','ail-ing','assets/photos/ailing.jpg','assets/anims/ailing.gif','assets/audio/ailing.m4a'),
('1e5633f8-808e-5c84-9c13-e7c6802393e9','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',3,'term',1,'{14}','Glance','A quick, brief look at someone or something.','Shennong cast a curious [Glance] toward the cauldron boiling over the open fire.','نظرة خاطفة','glance','assets/photos/glance.jpg','assets/anims/glance.gif','assets/audio/glance.m4a'),
('48005a27-0d43-51ba-8e32-5a4e89ae94b3','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',4,'term',1,'{}','Unpalatable','Distasteful, unpleasant to drink or eat.','The court physician prepared a bitter herbal medicine that was completely [Unpalatable].','كريه المذاق','un-pal-at-a-ble','assets/photos/unpalatable.jpg','assets/anims/unpalatable.gif','assets/audio/unpalatable.m4a'),
('1fa391fc-134b-5481-a25b-512e283e35f2','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',5,'term',1,'{}','Insisted','Demanded firmly and forcefully without taking no for an answer.','The royal doctor [Insisted] that the emperor drink the bitter concoction to regain his health.','أصرّ','in-sist-ed','assets/photos/insisted.jpg','assets/anims/insisted.gif','assets/audio/insisted.m4a'),
('57216382-fcdf-5d92-8586-c321fa301de9','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',6,'term',1,'{}','Behead','To cut off the head of a person as an ancient form of capital punishment.','Out of anger, the monarch threatened to [Behead] any servant who brought him bad news.','قطع الرأس','be-head','assets/photos/behead.jpg','','assets/audio/behead.m4a'),
('b5ba6629-d7a2-5d23-8438-1a86c1e41c4f','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',7,'term',1,'{}','Aroma','A pleasant, distinctive, and fragrant smell.','As the wild leaves steeped in boiling water, a rich, soothing [Aroma] filled the air.','رائحة زكية','a-ro-ma','assets/photos/aroma.jpg','assets/anims/aroma.gif','assets/audio/aroma.m4a'),
('d1b028fb-ab02-56ac-979e-b546f33ea333','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',8,'term',1,'{}','Fantastic','Extraordinarily good, wonderful, or astonishing.','The accidentally brewed golden liquid tasted absolutely [Fantastic] and refreshed the king.','رائع','fan-tas-tic','assets/photos/fantastic.jpg','assets/anims/fantastic.gif','assets/audio/fantastic.m4a'),
('0c0a5912-0126-533e-872a-a3440679b019','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',9,'term',1,'{}','Exhilaration','A feeling of intense excitement, energy, or happiness.','After drinking the warm liquid, a surge of renewed energy and [Exhilaration] washed over his body.','ابتهاج','ex-hil-a-ra-tion','assets/photos/exhilaration.jpg','assets/anims/exhilaration.gif','assets/audio/exhilaration.m4a'),
('df627e5e-bdcd-5266-97ce-ad69769ca7a9','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',10,'term',1,'{}','Beverage','A drinkable liquid other than plain water.','Tea quickly transformed from an accidental brew into a beloved daily [Beverage].','مشروب','bev-er-age','assets/photos/beverage.jpg','','assets/audio/beverage.m4a'),
('c737d45b-d85c-5466-b5e4-37179db1e234','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',11,'term',1,'{}','Impact','A strong, noticeable effect or influence on a person or society.','The global spread of tea had a profound social [Impact] across different continents.','تأثير','im-pact','assets/photos/impact.jpg','assets/anims/impact.gif','assets/audio/impact.m4a'),
('256b7e4f-264e-5bb9-8230-af825823e817','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',12,'term',1,'{}','Tonic','A medicinal drink taken to give a feeling of health and well-being.','In ancient medicinal lore, tea was prized as a revitalizing health [Tonic].','مُقوٍّ / منشّط','ton-ic','assets/photos/tonic.jpg','','assets/audio/tonic.m4a'),
('88dc17b1-1795-531c-8cad-4d60aabffe17','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',13,'term',1,'{}','Distant','Far away in space or time; remote.','Traders transported tea leaves from remote Chinese mountain slopes to [Distant] foreign markets.','بعيد','dis-tant','assets/photos/distant.jpg','assets/anims/distant.gif','assets/audio/distant.m4a'),
('41adcd5b-45b3-5a27-a563-24b7950e718e','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',14,'term',1,'{}','Concord','A state of harmony, peace, and agreement between people.','Sharing a warm cup of tea encouraged peaceful conversation and social [Concord].','وئام','con-cord','assets/photos/concord.jpg','assets/anims/concord.gif','assets/audio/concord.m4a'),
('649a2caf-60de-54c7-99db-9285a73da381','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',15,'term',1,'{}','Addicting','Causing a strong habit or desire to consume repeatedly.','The refreshing taste and soothing warmth of tea made it pleasantly [Addicting] to millions.','يُسبّب التعلّق (الإدمان)','ad-dict-ing','assets/photos/addicting.jpg','','assets/audio/addicting.m4a'),
('08952545-3aae-5adf-9ab8-518a25b3bce5','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',16,'term',1,'{}','Region','A specific geographical area or division of a country or the world.','Specific tea plant varieties thrive best in the humid mountain [Region] of East Asia.','منطقة','re-gion','assets/photos/region.jpg','','assets/audio/region.m4a'),
('5e7762e3-edb1-5ccf-a2d2-66825b6d7267','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',17,'term',1,'{}','Exotic','Originating in or characteristic of a distant, foreign country.','European merchants viewed imported green tea as a rare and [Exotic] luxury.','غريب / أجنبي','ex-ot-ic','assets/photos/exotic.jpg','','assets/audio/exotic.m4a'),
('9dffc736-f113-5abc-9cde-7dcb1fd1018a','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',18,'term',1,'{}','Blend','A mixture of different types or varieties combined together.','Master tea artisans carefully created a unique herbal [Blend] to suit every palate.','مزيج','blend','assets/photos/blend.jpg','assets/anims/blend.gif','assets/audio/blend.m4a'),
('ff3dd10a-df2a-5779-9f35-b149c4afc6b2','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',19,'term',1,'{}','Traditional','Following long-established customs, beliefs, or methods.','Serving tea in delicate porcelain pots remains a cherished [Traditional] ceremony.','تقليدي','tra-di-tion-al','assets/photos/traditional.jpg','','assets/audio/traditional.m4a'),
('d40cab4c-d13a-5fd1-8e13-921343363061','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',20,'term',2,'{}','Reside','To live or dwell permanently or for a long period in a place.','Roly-poly pill bugs typically [Reside] in damp soil under rocks and rotting logs.','يسكن / يقيم','re-side','assets/photos/reside.jpg','','assets/audio/reside.m4a'),
('fd4fc737-7158-551e-951f-769134318738','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',21,'term',2,'{}','Life-threatening','Capable of causing death; extremely dangerous.','Dehydration is a [Life-threatening] condition for land crustaceans if they stay in the sun.','مهدِّد للحياة','life-threat-en-ing','assets/photos/life-threatening.jpg','','assets/audio/life-threatening.m4a'),
('f46468bd-645e-574e-8daa-2875d35306e9','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',22,'term',2,'{}','Crucial','Extremely important or necessary for the success or balance of something.','Pill bugs perform a [Crucial] ecological role by breaking down decaying organic matter.','بالغ الأهمية','cru-cial','assets/photos/crucial.jpg','','assets/audio/crucial.m4a'),
('d540d1a8-e4a3-5a49-a54b-d92b8a75cf5e','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',23,'term',2,'{}','Nicknamed','Given a familiar, informal, or humorous name.','Because they roll into tight balls when startled, pill bugs are [Nicknamed] armadillo bugs.','يُلقَّب','nick-named','assets/photos/nicknamed.jpg','','assets/audio/nicknamed.m4a'),
('3d85f6fe-f954-5e77-b2d9-609089853aec','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',24,'term',2,'{}','Moist','Slightly wet or damp; dampness required for survival.','Pill bugs rely on gills and must live in [Moist] subterranean environments.','رطب','moist','assets/photos/moist.jpg','','assets/audio/moist.m4a'),
('990951eb-8df9-58fc-b188-cc1831061222','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',25,'term',2,'{}','Species','A group of living organisms consisting of similar individuals.','Scientists have identified thousands of distinct [Species] of land and aquatic crustaceans.','أنواع','spe-cies','assets/photos/species.jpg','','assets/audio/species.m4a'),
('a500620d-b2b2-5c9d-a54b-c9ab8c1955a8','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',26,'term',2,'{}','Appearance','The way that someone or something looks on the outside.','Despite their insect-like [Appearance], pill bugs are actually land-dwelling crustaceans.','مظهر','ap-pear-ance','assets/photos/appearance.jpg','','assets/audio/appearance.m4a'),
('3cec9d8f-1d33-533f-a833-8565f21c47c6','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',27,'term',2,'{}','Allergic','Having an adverse or sensitive physical reaction to a substance.','Certain individuals may have an [Allergic] reaction to bee stings.','تحسُّسي','al-ler-gic','assets/photos/allergic.jpg','','assets/audio/allergic.m4a'),
('7f311f4a-4368-5b3d-95c1-dfe458e63d34','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',28,'term',2,'{}','Organism','An individual animal, plant, or single-celled life form.','Every tiny [Organism] in the soil contributes to maintaining a healthy ecosystem.','كائن حي','or-gan-ism','assets/photos/organism.jpg','','assets/audio/organism.m4a'),
('4de8b600-03fa-5bb4-ac57-4b047e0e577e','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',29,'term',2,'{}','Ecological','Relating to the relation of living organisms to one another and their environment.','Decomposers play a vital [Ecological] function by recycling dead leaf matter into soil nutrients.','بيئي','e-co-log-i-cal','assets/photos/ecological.jpg','','assets/audio/ecological.m4a'),
('ba7f5206-affc-53ce-9983-3d214f492374','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',30,'term',2,'{}','Molting','The natural process of shedding an outer shell, skin, or feathers to grow.','As a pill bug grows larger, it undergoes [Molting] to replace its hard exoskeleton.','انسلاخ','molt-ing','assets/photos/molting.jpg','','assets/audio/molting.m4a'),
('3ae477d8-8f22-58e3-9697-e7c14eab2c44','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',31,'term',2,'{}','Entomologist','A scientist who studies insects and terrestrial creepy-crawlies.','An expert [Entomologist] studies how honeybees communicate through waggle dances.','عالم حشرات','en-to-mol-o-gist','assets/photos/entomologist.jpg','','assets/audio/entomologist.m4a'),
('21d7cec2-30ac-58f5-a881-82d481a15b7e','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',32,'term',2,'{}','Crustacean','A hard-shelled invertebrate creature such as a crab, shrimp, or pill bug.','A pill bug is a land [Crustacean] that breathes through specialized gills underneath its body.','قِشْري (من القشريات)','crus-ta-cean','assets/photos/crustacean.jpg','','assets/audio/crustacean.m4a'),
('05df8a2b-d7cb-5fe1-a8da-9b1e129f1ee1','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',33,'term',2,'{}','Nocturnal','Done, occurring, or active during the night rather than daytime.','Owls and pill bugs are [Nocturnal] creatures that search for food under the cover of darkness.','ليلي','noc-tur-nal','assets/photos/nocturnal.jpg','','assets/audio/nocturnal.m4a'),
('dfe272cc-a486-5965-af4d-c2bb4cbcf9b2','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',34,'term',3,'{}','Bookkeeper','A person whose job is to keep detailed financial records for a business.','Before succeeding as a famous author, Walter de la Mare worked as an office [Bookkeeper].','ماسك دفاتر / محاسب','book-keep-er','assets/photos/bookkeeper.jpg','','assets/audio/bookkeeper.m4a'),
('7396a21f-b7bc-5aed-9659-03e41b08fb49','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',35,'term',3,'{}','Monotonous','Lacking in variety and interest; tediously repetitive and dull.','Writing endless financial numbers in ledgers felt extremely [Monotonous] to the young poet.','رتيب','mo-not-o-nous','assets/photos/monotonous.jpg','assets/anims/monotonous.gif','assets/audio/monotonous.m4a'),
('710b57b4-8d39-5cad-8056-3e4618369db2','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',36,'term',3,'{}','Published','Prepared and issued printed books or literature for public sale.','After years of writing late at night, his first poetry collection was successfully [Published].','نُشِر','pub-lished','assets/photos/published.jpg','','assets/audio/published.m4a'),
('fffc47fe-f86a-5ee2-b200-3743031c3b4b','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',37,'term',3,'{}','Pseudonym','A fictitious pen name used by an author to publish written work.','Walter de la Mare initially published his imaginative stories under a pen [Pseudonym].','اسم مستعار','pseu-do-nym','assets/photos/pseudonym.jpg','','assets/audio/pseudonym.m4a'),
('11d7cd9c-945e-587b-bc08-5b39d1a06886','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',38,'term',3,'{}','Pension','A regular payment made by the government or employer to a retired person.','A civil list government [Pension] allowed the author to resign from accounting and write full-time.','معاش تقاعدي','pen-sion','assets/photos/pension.jpg','','assets/audio/pension.m4a'),
('4c5eb664-5cfc-5eb1-85a4-526edfb7eea1','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',39,'term',3,'{}','Rejuvenated','Feeling young, energetic, and fresh again.','Living in the peaceful countryside [Rejuvenated] his mind and inspired new children''s stories.','جدّد نشاطه','re-ju-ve-nat-ed','assets/photos/rejuvenated.jpg','','assets/audio/rejuvenated.m4a'),
('c1e76712-c86c-5feb-8d12-610945695567','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',40,'term',3,'{}','Casements','A window frame opening on hinges along its vertical side.','The pale silvery moonlight glimmers across the glass [Casements] of the old cottage.','نوافذ مفصلية','case-ments','assets/photos/casements.jpg','','assets/audio/casements.m4a'),
('bb4d5c65-5592-5f8d-ad3d-53744d73204d','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',41,'term',3,'{}','Thatch','A roof covering made of dry straw, reeds, or palm leaves.','Dewdrops sparkled upon the golden straw [Thatch] of the sleeping farmhouses.','سقف من القش','thatch','assets/photos/thatch.jpg','','assets/audio/thatch.m4a'),
('176f389b-868f-5ac0-83ae-85092fca59d0','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',42,'term',3,'{}','Couched','Lying down comfortably, resting, or crouching.','The loyal watchdog slumbered safely, [Couched] like a log inside his wooden kennel.','رابض','couched','assets/photos/couched.jpg','assets/anims/couched.gif','assets/audio/couched.m4a'),
('9911e128-7b08-509b-ac73-b18cee7faeab','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',43,'term',3,'{}','Kennel','A small shelter or house constructed for a dog.','The watchdog rested peacefully inside his cozy outdoor [Kennel].','بيت الكلب','ken-nel','assets/photos/kennel.jpg','','assets/audio/kennel.m4a'),
('9967d86a-b3ce-5061-bb7a-cc0f42771e00','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',44,'term',3,'{}','Shadowy','Full of shadows, dark, dim, or faintly visible.','A secretive mouse scampered through the [Shadowy] corners of the moonlit barn.','مُظلِم','shad-ow-y','assets/photos/shadowy.jpg','','assets/audio/shadowy.m4a'),
('0acacbbf-00f8-5599-8480-302a45939a2c','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',45,'term',3,'{}','Harvest','The process or period of gathering in mature crops from the fields.','The bright full moon shone brilliantly over the autumn [Harvest] fields.','حصاد','har-vest','assets/photos/harvest.jpg','','assets/audio/harvest.m4a'),
('efe785e9-c91c-50a8-922e-47faa20001e7','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',46,'term',3,'{}','Scampering','Running quickly with light, short, hurried steps.','A tiny gray rodent went [Scampering] across the cold stone floor.','يركض مسرعًا','scam-per-ing','assets/photos/scampering.jpg','assets/anims/scampering.gif','assets/audio/scampering.m4a'),
('3b07a687-b696-52de-befb-1c3040048cf0','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',47,'term',3,'{}','Gleam','A faint or brief shine of bright light reflected on a surface.','The tranquil stream reflected a silvery [Gleam] as it flowed past the sleeping trees.','بريق / لمعان','gleam','assets/photos/gleam.jpg','assets/anims/gleam.gif','assets/audio/gleam.m4a'),
('dbb46995-0c69-53c2-a1f9-be9b1392232c','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',48,'term',3,'{}','Reeds','Tall, slender, feather-like grasses growing in wet areas.','Wild fish moved silently among the dark water [Reeds] along the riverbank.','قصب','reeds','assets/photos/reeds.jpg','','assets/audio/reeds.m4a'),
