('3b1b2939-adeb-5be4-9d24-fd840356b396','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',50,'term',3,'{}','Peers','Looks at something or someone carefully.','The curious cat [Peers] through the window at the birds outside.','يُحدِّق بعناية','peers','assets/photos/peers.jpg','assets/anims/peers.gif','assets/audio/peers.m4a'),
('6bfa260c-54fd-502a-ba07-1dfa82659467','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',51,'term',3,'{}','Cote','A shelter for birds.','The white doves sleep safely inside their wooden [Cote].','بيت الحمام','cote','assets/photos/cote.jpg','','assets/audio/cote.m4a'),
('889d0241-ce90-5e74-b968-fe87ab3840f6','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',52,'term',3,'{}','Flowing','Moving along smoothly and steadily, like water in a river.','Her long hair was [Flowing] in the gentle breeze.','متدفِّق / منساب','flow-ing','assets/photos/flowing.jpg','assets/anims/flowing.gif','assets/audio/flowing.m4a'),
('057702c9-d24f-50fc-900b-f9525890fec2','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',53,'term',3,'{}','Withdrew','Moved back or away from something, or stopped taking part in it.','The shy boy [Withdrew] to a quiet corner of the room.','انسحب','with-drew','assets/photos/withdrew.jpg','assets/anims/withdrew.gif','assets/audio/withdrew.m4a'),
('3ef12971-85ef-5b1e-a9a3-338512939194','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',54,'term',3,'{}','Peep','To look quickly or secretly, often through a small gap.','The little mouse likes to [Peep] out of its hole to see if the cat is gone.','يختلس النظر','peep','','assets/anims/peep.gif','assets/audio/peep.m4a'),
('96ab8e40-94e6-5b58-882d-19fcc5fa0389','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',55,'term',3,'{}','Beam','A line of light that shines from something bright.','A silver [Beam] of moonlight shone through the window.','شعاع ضوء','beam','assets/photos/beam.jpg','assets/anims/beam.gif','assets/audio/beam.m4a'),
('9d7259fd-26d1-58ab-a7fd-685c19eb4e04','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',56,'term',3,'{}','Beneath','Under or below something.','The fish swam silently [Beneath] the water.','تحت / أسفل','be-neath','assets/photos/beneath.jpg','assets/anims/beneath.gif','assets/audio/beneath.m4a'),
('c5e0db6f-e72f-503c-b69d-d1452c69131a','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',57,'term',4,'{}','Relentlessly','Showing determination without stopping.','The team practised [Relentlessly] until they won the final match.','بإصرار دون توقُّف','re-lent-less-ly','assets/photos/relentlessly.jpg','assets/anims/relentlessly.gif','assets/audio/relentlessly.m4a'),
('752a8bc4-b09c-5267-9765-b6252712ce49','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',58,'term',4,'{}','Starving','Feel very hungry.','After the long hike, the children were [Starving] and ate everything.','يتضوّر جوعًا','starv-ing','assets/photos/starving.jpg','assets/anims/starving.gif','assets/audio/starving.m4a'),
('246a9982-959a-5844-8aa2-6f470e75ccb1','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',59,'term',4,'{}','Nervous','Worried.','Sara felt [Nervous] before giving her speech to the class.','متوتِّر / قلِق','ner-vous','assets/photos/nervous.jpg','assets/anims/nervous.gif','assets/audio/nervous.m4a'),
('bda34b1c-3043-5401-a322-bb7c96099a77','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',60,'term',4,'{}','Ferocious','Fierce.','The [Ferocious] lion roared loudly across the hills.','شَرِس','fe-ro-cious','assets/photos/ferocious.jpg','assets/anims/ferocious.gif','assets/audio/ferocious.m4a'),
('309141a4-26e8-5c1a-a446-cd93d37a1477','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',61,'term',4,'{}','Deliberately','Intentionally.','He [Deliberately] left the gate open so the dog could come inside.','عَمْدًا / عن قصد','de-lib-er-ate-ly','assets/photos/deliberately.jpg','assets/anims/deliberately.gif','assets/audio/deliberately.m4a'),
('97e35765-9b90-558a-b85c-c62ce5de1404','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',62,'term',4,'{8}','Brilliant','Very smart.','The [Brilliant] rabbit thought of a clever plan to help her friends.','ذكيّ جدًا','bril-liant','assets/photos/brilliant.jpg','assets/anims/brilliant.gif','assets/audio/brilliant.m4a'),
('1aa0a6f8-d008-5b7f-8ed7-188578c8f6aa','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005',63,'term',5,'{}','Rustled','Made a soft swishing sound.','The dry leaves [Rustled] as the wind blew through the trees.','خَشْخَش','rus-tled','assets/photos/rustled.jpg','assets/anims/rustled.gif','assets/audio/rustled.m4a'),
